    {
      "bbox": [
        395,
        577,
        1300,
        680
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, By purchase on September 22, 1972 and November 7, 1974, The City of New York acquired for park purposes a tract of land of approximately 80 acres in the Borough of Staten Island, known as Sailors' Snug Harbor;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.381,
          "min": -2.2183
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 62,
          "mean": -0.0048,
          "min": -0.2071
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15576,
        "area_px": 94536,
        "density": 0.16476,
        "chars": 218,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        398,
        643,
        1284,
        768
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Sailors' Snug Harbor temporarily remains occupied by its former owners, the institution for retired seamen, which will be relocated to new facilities, after which the property will be available for park, recreational and cultural facility is required to be developed;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3346,
          "min": -1.8285
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0113,
          "min": -0.3851
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 18652,
        "area_px": 111250,
        "density": 0.16766,
        "chars": 276,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 14.8
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        403,
        734,
        1300,
        810
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Sailors' Snug Harbor is a park, recreational and cultural resource of great significance for the Borough of Staten Island;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3343,
          "min": -2.1656
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 27,
          "mean": -0.0037,
          "min": -0.0807
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 10155,
        "area_px": 68476,
        "density": 0.1483,
        "chars": 131,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 12.9
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        405,
        799,
        1300,
        877
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and appropriate that there be participation by the citizens of the Borough of Staten Island in the planning for and maintenance of the development of Sailors' Snug Harbor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.3805,
          "min": -1.5935
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 38,
          "mean": -0.0786,
          "min": -1.2377
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 14957,
        "area_px": 71021,
        "density": 0.2106,
        "chars": 196,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 13.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        386,
        904,
        1308,
        982
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereunder ceded to all interested parties that the City of New York, in its capacity as the Administrator of Parks, Recreation and Cultural Affairs, shall, consist of the Administrator of Parks, Recreation and Cultural Affairs, the Director of City Planning and such other persons, not to exceed twenty, as shall be appointed to such Board by the Mayor. The Board shall have a chairman who shall be named by the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.383,
          "min": -1.6239
        },
        "category": {
